<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Bancorp raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Bancorp raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said that it upgraded U.S. Bancorp to a strong buy from a neutral rating.</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
